#: c8aa8085e48f4373930087880e13379f
msgid ""
"Copter, Plane and Rover support up to 3-axis gimbals, including advance "
"features like automated aiming of the camera at a Region of Interest (ROI), "
"and automatic triggering of a camera shutter.  Follow the links below to "
"explanations of how to configure gimbals and shutter triggering."
msgstr ""
"Copter、Plane 和 Rover "
"最多支持三轴云台，包括将相机自动瞄准感兴趣区域（ROI）和自动触发相机快门等高级功能。请通过以下链接了解如何配置云台和快门触发。"

