#: e97bc4babe00428ca681638bc6a060f8
msgid "Common fixes for poor video quality"
msgstr "视频质量差的常见修复方法"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cameras-and-gimbals.rst:75
#: ../../source/docs/common-cameras-and-gimbals.rst:79
#: 0d23ab8bcf584f03a79fca1fe79aba4d 30e6e9ceb2fe4a11887c40ac89f98d83
#: 681ce9a1775345e487480149f6d96acc 9ff57d0102b3483aabaabeed05a29047
#: b90a2fc91b184a95a027f0eac8faf52f
msgid ""
"Some of the more common causes and solutions for poor video are listed "
"below:"
msgstr "以下列出了一些更常见的视频质量差的原因及解决方案："

#: ../../source/docs/common-cameras-and-gimbals.rst:78
#: ../../source/docs/common-cameras-and-gimbals.rst:82
#: 0ac5e91e1ac845cb9176d333c50b0734 0d3c9770c94d46b58acaecef57aa8a8c
#: 331528ce53524a95be865efffb71d683 40d9cfd874cb47b39d1e66d2c2a1136e
#: 89aa4a167d8643df9fa902a74c74c5e2
msgid ""
"\"Jello\" effect (or rolling shutter) is a by-product of using a camera with"
" a CMOS sensor (GoPro, et al) caused by vibration from unbalanced "
"props/motors and can be mitigated by mounting the camera on soft rubber, "
"silicone, foam ear plugs or sometimes just on velcro."
msgstr ""
"「果冻」效应（或滚动快门）是使用 CMOS 传感器相机（GoPro "
"等）时由于螺旋桨/电机不平衡引起的震动副产品，可通过将相机安装在软橡胶、硅胶、泡沫耳塞上，有时仅靠魔术贴来缓解。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cameras-and-gimbals.rst:82
#: ../../source/docs/common-cameras-and-gimbals.rst:86
#: 20af0293491b4bedb5b2e3fb468d75cd 34338b045c0b4b8890f4bd839b5ec106
#: a24d5f476f994d3eb0e13a719cfe108a b99f1c2291bf42369ba076db5f547ad4
#: c35753efa493414ebf5cfc5554c7d77b
msgid ""
"digital and optical stabilization systems found in many cameras often do not"
" perform well because of the vibrations found on many multicopters."
msgstr "许多相机中的数字和光学防抖系统由于多旋翼上存在的震动，往往表现不佳。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cameras-and-gimbals.rst:86
#: ../../source/docs/common-cameras-and-gimbals.rst:90
#: 0f7ef552a259440983d4a23fbf4eaead 141c498c66374fd09e91872c63b34907
#: 2e9a9ef00f414d60aabd948b033164b6 a3c5fea32ce7493591786975d0cf53da
#: e710616e89e24d87b5530d1aa5f044f0
msgid ""
"Exceptions: the Sony video camera balanced steady shot system is very "
"effective even at maximum 30 power zoom."
msgstr "例外：Sony 视频相机的平衡防抖系统即使在最大 30 倍变焦时也非常有效。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cameras-and-gimbals.rst:89
#: ../../source/docs/common-cameras-and-gimbals.rst:93
#: 072d83f774ab456c987cbbf9d870bbea 1d095a6091884b029851b2be61ae538d
#: 449cdd3e18984be39f67263117b1cce5 6a7abf54faa4475f81e1f3f8cfbabcd4
#: 823b3cbce4e746c7a32b53b819f213d3
msgid ""
"For better and smoother Yaw, use Expo control on your RC and lower the "
":ref:`ACRO_Y_RATE<ACRO_Y_RATE>` gain in the autopilot."
msgstr ""
"为获得更好、更平滑的偏航，请在遥控器上使用 Expo 控制，并降低飞控中的 :ref:`ACRO_Y_RATE<ACRO_Y_RATE>` 增益。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cameras-and-gimbals.rst:92
#: ../../source/docs/common-cameras-and-gimbals.rst:96
#: 0d024a7d1ca64470ae066a4d7a43eaed 4613859199894190940d309ce47323ea
#: 518a7741b5c5460db687bd6cf9a22a68 6a5dbc9bce214824a0603b8baa64e69a
#: e9fd4d282c3a48059fb8eea24bd8d5e3
msgid ""
"It is important to remember that even with a perfect setup, photography is "
"an art as well as a science. Using the camera pointing straight to the "
"ground is a good place to start, but more dramatic viewpoints can be "
"achieved with angles other than vertical. Mount about 40 degrees deviation "
"from vertical to obtain mainly ground photos but with an oblique view. About"
" 70 degrees off vertical will give you a lot more sky thus giving more "
"scenic photos. ArduPilot will stabilize the gimbal to whatever position you "
"set."
msgstr ""
"重要的是要记住，即使设置完美，摄影也是一门艺术，同时也是科学。将相机镜头垂直向下是一个好的起点，但其他角度可以获得更有视觉冲击力的画面。安装时偏离垂直约"
" 40 度可主要拍摄地面但带有斜视效果。偏离垂直约 70 度会拍摄更多天空，从而获得更具风景感的照片。ArduPilot "
"会将云台稳定在您设定的任何位置。"

